" Vim-style keys for every page — websites, the new tab page, Settings,
" addons.mozilla.org — handled before the page sees them.
"
" A running browser re-reads this file within a second of it changing.
"
" Syntax (like Tridactyl's rc file):
"   bind <keys> <command> [args...]
"   unbind <keys>
"   set <name> <value>
"   " and # start comments
"
" Keys: characters as typed (G is shift+g), <C-x> ctrl, <A-x> alt,
" <S-Insert> shift+insert, and <Esc> <Space> <CR> <Tab> <BS> <Up> <Down>
" <Left> <Right> <PageUp> <PageDown> <Home> <End> <F1>..<F12> <lt>.
" Sequences are written together: gg, gt, <C-w>c.
" A number before a key repeats it: 5j scrolls five steps.
"
" Text fields get every key; <Esc> leaves them. <S-Insert> (toggleignore)
" turns the keys off for the current tab, for sites with their own shortcuts.

set hintchars asdfghjkl     " letters used for link hints
set scrollstep 70           " pixels per j/k
set smoothscroll true
set timeout 1500            " ms to wait for the rest of a sequence

" --- scrolling -------------------------------------------------------------
bind j scrolldown
bind k scrollup
bind h scrollleft
bind l scrollright
bind <C-d> halfpagedown
bind <C-u> halfpageup
bind <C-f> pagedown
bind <C-b> pageup
bind gg scrolltop
bind G scrollbottom

" --- history and reloading -------------------------------------------------
bind H back
bind L forward
bind r reload
bind R reloadhard
bind gu urlup
bind gU urlroot

" --- tabs (J/K follow the vertical tab list: J down, K up) -----------------
bind J tabnext
bind K tabprev
bind gt tabnext
bind gT tabprev
bind g0 tabfirst
bind g$ tablast
bind d tabclose
bind u tabundo
bind t tabopen
bind yt tabduplicate
bind gp tabpin
bind gb togglesidebar

" --- opening and copying ---------------------------------------------------
bind o open                 " address bar, ready to type
bind O opencurrent          " address bar with the current address to edit
bind p clipboardopen        " open the copied address/search here
bind P clipboardtabopen     " …in a new tab
bind yy yankurl

" --- hints and inputs ------------------------------------------------------
bind f hint                 " label links/buttons; type a label to click it
bind F hinttab              " …open the link in a background tab
bind gi focusinput          " jump into the first text field

" --- find and zoom ---------------------------------------------------------
bind / find
bind n findnext
bind N findprev
bind zi zoomin
bind zo zoomout
bind zz zoomreset

" --- modes -----------------------------------------------------------------
bind <S-Insert> toggleignore
